!!! =============================================================================
!!! sdkinstaller — Workload and component registry
!!! =============================================================================
!!!
!!! The built-in workloads and components that the installer knows how to deploy.
!!! These are the curated sets — the "core" workload plus modular extras,
!!! inspired by the Visual Studio installer.

book sdkinstaller.workloads

read everything from sdkinstaller.config


!!! --- Component registry: every component the installer can deploy.
!!!
!!! Components are the atomic unit. Workloads reference them by ID.
!!! Each component has a stable id, display name, description, a kind
!!! controlling how it is installed, a size estimate, and dependencies.

public build-components returns array of Component begin paragraph
    value components as array of Component is [
        !!! --- Core workload components ---
        build Component with
            id being "core.compiler",
            name being "NIL Compiler",
            description being "The Matrix and Ny source-to-NIL compiler (nilcompiler).",
            kind being ComponentKind.FrameworkFiles,
            sizeBytes being 2097152,
            dependencies being [],
            sourcePath being "compiler/",
            envVar being "",
            envValue being "",
            templatePath being "",

        build Component with
            id being "core.interpreter",
            name being "NIL Interpreter",
            description being "The nilinterpreter runtime for executing NIL bytecode.",
            kind being ComponentKind.FrameworkFiles,
            sizeBytes being 1048576,
            dependencies being [],
            sourcePath being "interpreter/",
            envVar being "",
            envValue being "",
            templatePath being "",

        build Component with
            id being "core.nilbuild",
            name being "nilbuild",
            description being "The nilbuild project build tool.",
            kind being ComponentKind.FrameworkFiles,
            sizeBytes being 786432,
            dependencies being [],
            sourcePath being "tools/nilbuild/",
            envVar being "PATH",
            envValue being "",
            templatePath being "",

        build Component with
            id being "core.nilstd",
            name being "nilstd",
            description being "The NIL standard library source (nilstd/).",
            kind being ComponentKind.FrameworkFiles,
            sizeBytes being 524288,
            dependencies being [],
            sourcePath being "nilstd/",
            envVar being "",
            envValue being "",
            templatePath being "",

        build Component with
            id being "core.nillib",
            name being "nillib",
            description being "The NIL library source (nillib/).",
            kind being ComponentKind.FrameworkFiles,
            sizeBytes being 262144,
            dependencies being [],
            sourcePath being "nillib/",
            envVar being "",
            envValue being "",
            templatePath being "",

        build Component with
            id being "core.testing",
            name being "Testing harness",
            description being "The niltest runner and conformance suite.",
            kind being ComponentKind.FrameworkFiles,
            sizeBytes being 131072,
            dependencies being [],
            sourcePath being "tools/niltest/",
            envVar being "",
            envValue being "",
            templatePath being "",

        !!! --- UI development extras ---
        build Component with
            id being "ui.gtk4-runtime",
